n1-2\\sin^2\\left(\\frac{15\\pi}{8}\\right)&=\\cos\\left(2\\cdot \\frac{15\\pi}{8}\\right)\\\\&=\\cos\\left(\\frac{15\\pi}{4}\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nKeep the outside factor:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\frac{2}{3}\\left(1-2\\sin^2\\left(\\frac{15\\pi}{8}\\right)\\right)&=\\frac{2}{3}\\cos\\left(\\frac{15\\pi}{4}\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "e35eacaf-be9a-53a1-bb9d-ba4a75053b16" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "e35eacaf-be9a-53a1-bb9d-ba4a75053b16" :question/answer-fields "4a2f71b9-a0f6-53fb-8405-8d0d50228688"] [:db/ensure "e35eacaf-be9a-53a1-bb9d-ba4a75053b16" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087670 :knowledge-point/questions "e35eacaf-be9a-53a1-bb9d-ba4a75053b16"] [:db/add "a9e66256-732f-5a65-9e8d-405b2e19c3f2" :answer/id #uuid "a9e66256-732f-5a65-9e8d-405b2e19c3f2"] [:db/add "a9e66256-732f-5a65-9e8d-405b2e19c3f2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "a9e66256-732f-5a65-9e8d-405b2e19c3f2" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}\\cos\\left(183^\\circ\\right)"] [:db/ensure "a9e66256-732f-5a65-9e8d-405b2e19c3f2" :answer/validate] [:db/add "66e7ed88-bcc6-5e63-a2c1-758726c59ba5" :answer/id #uuid "66e7ed88-bcc6-5e63-a2c1-758726c59ba5"] [:db/add "66e7ed88-bcc6-5e63-a2c1-758726c59ba5" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "66e7ed88-bcc6-5e63-a2c1-758726c59ba5" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}\\cos\\left(61^\\circ\\right)"] [:db/ensure "66e7ed88-bcc6-5e63-a2c1-758726c59ba5" :answer/validate] [:db/add "313982ed-9ff4-5943-846d-5656b6c49e9e" :answer/id #uuid "313982ed-9ff4-5943-846d-5656b6c49e9e"] [:db/add "313982ed-9ff4-5943-846d-5656b6c49e9e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "313982ed-9ff4-5943-846d-5656b6c49e9e" :answer/value "\\frac{6}{5}\\cos\\left(244^\\circ\\right)"] [:db/ensure "313982ed-9ff4-5943-846d-5656b6c49e9e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "70626ff1-ed24-5be3-9574-607588fb40d2" :answer/id #uuid "70626ff1-ed24-5be3-9574-607588fb40d2"] [:db/add "70626ff1-ed24-5be3-9574-607588fb40d2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "